Package: vabaxos-apt
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: apt (>= 2.4), debian-archive-keyring, ca-certificates, unattended-upgrades
Description: where VabaxOS gets its updates from
 The sources of APT for VabaxOS (ADR-0020, ADR-0028): Debian at a date
 checked by VabaxOS (snapshot.debian.org), not Debian day by day; Debian's
 security archive as it is today; and the signed VabaxOS archive with the
 VabaxOS packages. APT reads its sources only from the files of this
 package; /etc/apt/sources.list, written by the installer and by
 live-build, is not used.
 .
 Security updates install by themselves every day (unattended-upgrades,
 only Debian's security archive and VabaxOS's rebuilt Debian packages);
 the updates of VabaxOS only when the user asks.
